ces and technologies. To be initially eligible for the Clean-Tech Metals Index, companies must generate at least 50% of their revenues from green metals or have at least 50% of their mineral resources related to green metals.","risks":[["Green Metals Risk Member","Green Metals Risk. Investments in companies involved in the production, refining, processing and recycling of green metals used to facilitate the energy transition from fossil fuels to cleaner energy sources and technologies are subject to a variety of risks. Under certain market conditions, the Fund may underperform as compared to funds that invest in a broader range of investments. There may be significant differences in interpretations of what is considered a green metal and the definition used by the Index Provider may differ with those used by other investors, investment advisers or …"]],"risk_narrative":null},"ncen":{"series":"S000073995","name":"VanEck Copper and Green Metals ETF","lei":"549300HH7TQ7LX754417","acc":"0001410368-26-024760","filed":"2026-03-13","period":"2025-12-31","cik":1137360,"index":true,"index_affiliated":true,"index_exclusive":false,"multi_inverse":false,"fund_of_funds":false,"non_diversified":true,"track_diff_gross":0.238,"track_diff":-0.809,"track_err_gross":0.965,"track_err":0.965,"lends":true,"lending_ok":true,"avg_on_loan":2088642.91,"lending_income":14628.0,"expense_cap":false,"fees_waived":false,"commissions":6296.14,"principal_trades":5628899.44,"avg_net_assets":20717442.413077,"mgmt_fee":null,"net_expenses":null,"price":null,"nav":null,"derivatives_rule":false,"line_of_credit":true,"registrant":{"name":"VanEck ETF Trust","file_num":"811-10325","lei":"549300ZLFKNTXC51ZN76","family":"VANECKFUND","type":"N-1A","state":"US-NY","material_weakness":false,"accountant_changed":false,"legal_proceeding":false},"accountant":["PricewaterhouseCoopers LLP"],"distributor":[["Van Eck Securities Corporation",true]],"board":[["David H. Chow",false],["Jan F. Van Eck",true],["Laurie A. Hes